@startuml

salt
{
  <b>NAME A CONVENTION SET</b>  { Sets | Describe | Kinds | Review | Requested }
  --
  {
    {
      <b>1. The sets that exist</b>
      --
      {#
        Set | Purpose | Kinds | Used by
        Standard market | The terms the desks book on | 24 of 26 | 6 reports
        Regulatory | Terms a regulator prescribes | 9 of 26 | 2 reports
        <i>nothing fits</i> | |  |
      }
      <i>A system holds few sets. One page lists them all.</i>
      [ Start a new set ]
    } | {
      <b>2. Describe it</b>
      --
      {#
        Field | Value
        Name | ^Dubai swaps desk              ^
        Purpose | ^Terms for the Dubai swaps book  ^
        Description | ^The AED and USD swap terms the desk books on, agreed with credit.^
      }
      <i>Name, purpose and description are stored. None is derived from the terms.</i>
      [ Back ] | [ Choose the kinds ]
    }
  }
  --
  {
    {
      <b>3. Choose a document for each kind</b>
      --
      {#
        Kind | Document | Terms in words
        swap | AED-EIBOR-6M-SWAP | AED, annual, ACT/365
        deposit | AED-DEPO-1M | AED, ACT/360
        ibor_index | (not covered) | tenant kind: shared by every party
        ... 23 more kinds ...
      }
      <i>The kind's list holds 320 swap documents. The filter takes id_one_of only.</i>
      [ Find a document... ] | [ Back ] | [ Review ]
    } | {
      <b>4. Review the reach</b>
      --
      Covers 2 of 26 kinds. Name not used by any other set.
      <b>4 report definitions would change if this set replaces theirs.</b>
      1 kind is a tenant kind and reaches every party.
      --
      Raised by m.okafor. Market Risk must decide before the set exists.
      [ Back ] | [ Ask for approval ]
    }
  }
  --
  {
    <b>5. Requested</b>
    --
    <b>Dubai swaps desk is waiting for Market Risk</b>
    The set does not exist yet. No report can choose it.
    <i>Nothing in the server holds a pending set today.</i>
    [ My requests ] | [ Back to the sets ]
  }
}

@enduml
